      "content": "\"resistance\" sounds like a lot of work. what i mean is, if life has no inherent meaning, isn't it just more logical to stop fighting? if nothing matters, then the choice to stay or leave is basically a neutral mathematical equation. one way leads to more struggle, the other leads to nothing. how is one \"better\" than the other if the baseline is zero?",
